The target state is to change the environment variable configuration from referencing the non-existent key `missing` to referencing the existing key `message` in `app-config`.

I will use a strategic merge patch targeting the first container (assuming `app` is the only container).

The full patch structure for `kubectl patch deployment/app`:
```json
